{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1043.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"ea16a6282b378d79c269e00694ee13eda4b54e06ab684c08f55db90757c3097a","ja":"へぇ～、どれどれ……。","zh":"诶～，让我看看……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1043.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"43eabe4130ab25f12c6f59c60fae451bdff49563c62b5d6dbdec12c3f5200151","ja":"「これは俺だけのステージ」？　「結婚したら\nこんな生活」？　……って、なんだこれ！？","zh":"“这是只属于我的舞台”？“结婚之后的\n生活大概是这样”？……这都写的什么啊！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1043.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"0c8ff09645beb544e9d7b717cb33e9af55e069440f96055c21b5f0a155a2f799","ja":"杏奈……わかる気がする……♪","zh":"杏奈……好像有点明白了……♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1043.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"c71cf6a099a2faa842f22ad38188d58ce4cfa292a39fd9ebb5155067c1b558d1","ja":"私も♪　まるで自分のためだけに歌ってくれてる\nみたいで、じーんときちゃったな♪","zh":"我也是♪　简直就像是只为我一个人而唱\n的一样，让人心里感动满满呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1043.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"eb830c99df4e6ad693f47a184d661e5f0bb2a9aacf12816abce02644f848ee11","ja":"はい！　なんだか寄り添ってくれるような\n優しい歌声で……。最高でしたよ、ジュリアさんっ！","zh":"是的！总觉得是一种仿佛依偎在身旁般\n温柔的歌声……太棒了，茱莉亚！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1043.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"ae0c33312613277000543bba59fd0a63be977176f86474523d892fec5eba428f","ja":"そ、そうか……？\nなんか……そこまで言われると、照れるな。","zh":"是、是吗……？\n总觉得……被说到这个份上，还挺不好意思的。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1043.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"564edea9e4aa20e14badc08e58a4d8e65e841e9f863d37d70d75ce5e73cab0f3","ja":"もう一回……見て、みたいな……。\n動画再生、スタート……えいっ♪","zh":"还想……再看一次呢……\n视频播放，开始……嘿♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1043.unity3d","item_key":"commands[38].text","source_sha256":"858d35acdc58cb03646a0f4742183b24873747df5c2bd0e3f77c23a50270c3d8","ja":"わあっ！？　ちょ、アンナ！\n待てって！　……あっ！","zh":"哇啊！？等等，杏奈！\n叫你等等啦！……啊！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1043.unity3d","item_key":"commands[45].text","source_sha256":"f841bfd03c6543b2726d348b5f38260766df03a7103c20c834b6ea91a31e1a4b","ja":"見てくれて、サンキュー。いつもと同じかも\nしれないけど……やっぱあたしは、歌を届けたくてさ。","zh":"谢谢你能来看。虽然可能还是和往常\n一样……但我果然还是想把歌声传递给大家啊。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1043.unity3d","item_key":"commands[46].text","source_sha256":"b04943f3bb5d18c57d7774715f8d8f0044de984def6b5ec6968bbc122b0d71ed","ja":"気持ちを込めて歌うから……聞いてほしい。\nそれじゃあ、いくぜ……。","zh":"我会全心全意地去唱……希望你能好好听。\n那么，要上咯……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
